     5→title: Shadow Branch
     6→type: module
     7→status:
     8→  maturity: draft
     9→  implementation: implemented
    10→description: |
    11→  Shadow branch for transparent spec/task state auto-tracking.
    12→  Uses gitignored worktree (.kspec/) pointing to orphan branch (kspec-meta).
    13→  Separates metadata commits from main branch history.
    14→
    15→  Key properties:
    16→  - Shadow branch has files at root (not nested under spec/)
    17→  - .kspec/ is a git worktree pointing to the shadow branch
    18→  - Main branch gitignores .kspec/
    19→  - All kspec read/write operations target .kspec/
    20→  - Changes auto-commit to shadow branch
    21→features:
    22→  - _ulid: 01KF1V1Z87Z7PTG4C68QSMK4EE
    23→    slugs:
    24→      - shadow-concept
    25→    title: Shadow Branch Concept
    26→    type: feature
    27→    status:
    28→      maturity: draft
    29→      implementation: implemented
    30→    priority: high
    31→    tags:
    32→      - infrastructure
    33→      - git
    34→    description: |
    35→      Orphan git branch storing kspec state in gitignored worktree.
    36→
    37→      Problem solved:
    38→      - Commit bloat from task state changes
    39→      - History pollution on main branch
    40→      - Review noise in PRs
    41→
    42→      Solution:
    43→      - Orphan branch (kspec-meta) with files at root
    44→      - .kspec/ worktree always available
    45→      - Auto-commit on state changes
    46→      - Main branch never touched by kspec operations
    47→    requirements:
