   249→        description: |-
   250→          Optional verbose output for shadow branch operations.
   251→
   252→          By default, auto-commit failures are silent (see @shadow-autocommit ac-6).
   253→          Debug mode surfaces these errors for troubleshooting.
   254→
   255→          Enable via:
   256→          - KSPEC_DEBUG=1 environment variable
   257→          - --debug-shadow flag on any command
   258→
   259→          When enabled:
   260→          - Auto-commit failures are reported to stderr
   261→          - Git operations show underlying commands
   262→          - Useful for diagnosing worktree/branch issues
