   540→    title: Shadow Remote Sync
   541→    type: feature
   542→    tags: []
   543→    description: Automatic synchronization of shadow branch with remote repository. After each local
   544→      auto-commit, attempt push to remote. On session start or read operations, pull remote changes
   545→      first.
   546→    depends_on: []
   547→    implements: []
   548→    relates_to: []
   549→    tests: []
   550→    created: 2026-01-16T20:20:38.087Z
   551→    acceptance_criteria:
   552→      - id: ac-1
   553→        given: remote tracking is configured for shadow branch
   554→        when: a state-changing operation commits to shadow branch
   555→        then: kspec attempts to push to remote (fire-and-forget, errors ignored)
   556→      - id: ac-2
   557→        given: remote tracking is configured
   558→        when: session start runs
   559→        then: kspec pulls remote changes before showing session context
   560→      - id: ac-3
   561→        given: pull encounters a conflict
   562→        when: sync is attempted
   563→        then: local operation succeeds, warning displayed, user directed to run kspec shadow resolve
   564→      - id: ac-4
   565→        given: no remote tracking configured
   566→        when: sync would normally occur
   567→        then: sync is silently skipped (no error)
   568→      - id: ac-5
   569→        given: shadow branch has unresolved sync conflict
   570→        when: user runs kspec shadow resolve
   571→        then: interactive conflict resolution guides user through resolving conflicts
   572→      - id: ac-6
   573→        given: sync uses git pull
   574→        when: pulling remote changes
   575→        then: uses --ff-only first, falls back to --rebase if needed
   576→      - id: ac-7
   577→        given: new shadow branch is created and origin remote exists
   578→        when: initializeShadow completes
   579→        then: tracking is configured to origin/kspec-meta regardless of push success
   580→      - id: ac-8
   581→        given: shadow branch exists without tracking and main branch has origin remote
   582→        when: any sync operation is attempted
   583→        then: tracking is automatically configured to origin/kspec-meta
